#: sd_runner/image_to_prompt/providers/captioner_provider.py:61
msgid ""
"Captioner backend requires torch + transformers. Install optional deps (e.g."
" `pip install -r requirements-optional.txt`)."
msgstr ""
"Captioner 백엔드에는 torch와 transformers가 필요합니다. 선택적 종속성을 설치하세요(예: `pip install "
"-r requirements-optional.txt`)."

#: sd_runner/image_to_prompt/providers/captioner_provider.py:129
